  "body": "WebKit will be restricting the URL schemes allowed in ping=\"\" to http and https. While the existing spec text allows UAs to \"selectively ignore URLs in the list,\" I think the spec should probably minimally call out the fact that file, blob, and data URLs don't really make any sense in ping=\"\".\n",
